      "Playmaker": ["Finesse Shot", "Pinged Pass", "Intercept", "Technical", "Incisive Pass", "Tiki Taka", "Low Driven Shot", "Anticipate", "First Touch", "Quick Step", "Inventive", "Press Proven", "Rapid"],
