      "Winger": ["Rapid", "Finesse Shot", "Pinged Pass", "Quick Step", "Enforcer", "Technical", "Low Driven Shot", "Gamechanger", "Incisive Pass", "Tiki Taka", "First Touch", "Inventive", "Press Proven"],
